; form-knowledge-exec-grammar-transport-observation.fk -- retained local
; readings from scannerless form.bml transport and two bounded repairs.
;
; The rows separate syntax transport from executable semantics.  E1/F1/G1
; used card v1; E2 used card v2 with one generic executable grammar example.
; Every row is supervised grammar transport with heldout credit withheld.
